This directory is reserved for firmware components built or modified for
the HY300 Lite (fenix). No components have been added yet.

When components are added, each one keeps the license of the code it was
built from (for example, U-Boot is GPL-2.0-or-later). The corresponding
source code and the licensing information for each component will be
documented here at that time.

Third-party binary blobs, if any are used (for example, from Rockchip's
rkbin), are not covered by that license. They keep their own terms and
will be listed here when added.
